This project includes modified copies of mods shipped with Herdr (https://herdr.dev),
also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  mods/garden-agents/main.js   derived from Herdr's `agents` mod
  mods/garden-pane/main.js     derived from Herdr's `pane` mod
  mods/garden-spaces/main.js   derived from Herdr's `spaces` mod
  mods/garden-chrome/main.js   derived from Herdr's `workspace-chrome` mod
  mods/garden-status/main.js   derived from Herdr's `workspace-status` mod
  layouts/code-garden.json     derived from Herdr's `main` layout

Each derived file says so in its first line and has been modified for this layout.
The SVG icons in mods/garden-chrome and mods/garden-pane are copied unchanged from
Herdr's shipped mods. Herdr's own `mods/workspace-chrome` icons are referenced, not copied.
